@startuml
title CCL-06 - UML activity: bounded research, risk fan-out, and decision
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Join selected typed specialist reports;
:Initialize round = 1 and depth = configured bound;
repeat
  fork
    :Bull researcher builds positive case\nfrom evidence and prior counterpoints;
  fork again
    :Bear researcher builds negative case\nfrom evidence and prior counterpoints;
  end fork
  :Validate schemas and evidence references;
  :Calculate directional support and\nevidence confidence separately;
  :Store round outputs and increment round;
repeat while (round <= depth?) is (yes)
:Research manager summarizes agreement and conflict;
:Create typed decision proposal;
fork
  :Aggressive risk view;
fork again
  :Balanced risk view;
fork again
  :Conservative risk view;
end fork
:Join three risk views;
:Apply user loss, position, horizon,\nexperience, sector, and currency policy;
if (Decision contract and hard limits valid?) then (yes)
  :Accept final decision-support result;
else (no)
  :Return explicit failure or safe HOLD / NO_DECISION;
endif
stop
@enduml
